WEBVTT

00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:14.360
It’s here.

00:01:50.890 --> 00:01:52.250
Heero.

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:17.570
Closing Gate 1, closing Gate 2.

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:20.170
Closing Gates 3 and 4.

00:02:20.170 --> 00:02:22.500
Closing Gates 5 and 6.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:25.200
Brussels Presidential Residence
blockade complete!

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:29.500
My castle is now
completely protected.

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:31.670
Don’t you find it strange?

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:33.710
Why should a shelter
such as this…

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:37.300
…be necessary in a peaceful
world with no weapons?

00:02:38.320 --> 00:02:43.010
History is much like
an endless waltz.

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:46.810
The three beats of war, peace
and revolution…

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:48.180
…continue on forever.

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:52.530
However, history will change
with my coronation.

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:56.900
The instant the year
After Colony 196 ends…

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.610
…I will be on the top
of the Earth Sphere.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:03.030
And a new age will arrive.

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:17.920
You’re dropping this colony
onto Earth?!

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:19.300
You’re nuts!

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:22.430
I’m piloting Nataku to wipe
out the evils of the universe!

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:26.640
The Alliance has already
decided to dispose of this colony.

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:28.430
Rather than just watch…

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:31.060
…it’d be better to go ahead
with Operation Meteor.

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:34.010
All we need to do is defeat
the necessary enemies!

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:41.450
I’ll destroy all the evil,
fair and square!

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:51.780
There he is.

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:09.810
Return to Forever

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:19.350
I won’t let you go to Earth.

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:26.070
Is this what you interpret
as justice?

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:28.120
I need to determine myself…

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:31.200
…whether or not peace at
the expense of people’s lives…

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:32.910
…can be defined as peace!

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:42.290
And I will become evil itself
to find out!

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:45.970
Humanity didn’t change.

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:50.300
All enemies were defeated,
but Earth didn’t change one bit!

00:05:00.330 --> 00:05:01.780
Well, now.

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:04.810
Quatre should be here
any time.

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:09.320
What the?

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:23.670
Hey!

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:26.010
You could’ve at least
come to help me!

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:29.300
There’s nothing wrong with
helping out a friend in need.

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:31.470
I wasn’t waiting for you.

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:33.070
But for someone else.

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:34.680
Sorry to keep you!

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:37.150
All hostages on this colony
have been rescued!

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:39.150
Okay, let’s go.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:40.020
I see.

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:41.710
So this is who you meant.

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:43.190
Thank you, Duo.

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:45.990
You were kind enough to leave
me plenty of good treats.

00:05:45.990 --> 00:05:48.530
If you’re joking, that’s cruel.

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:51.360
But if you’re being sarcastic,
that’s even worse!

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:15.850
The more you fight…

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:18.020
…the more sacrifices for
peace become a waste.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:20.260
You must’ve realized that!

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:33.030
The war we fought is over!

00:06:33.030 --> 00:06:34.830
So we don’t need warriors?

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:38.160
Do soldiers who know nothing
but battle get tossed aside?

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:43.090
Soldiers have fought to
attain a sense of peace!

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:45.840
Believe in the world we live in!

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:52.250
I’m acting for the people
who were used as weapons!

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:55.590
I’m fighting for all soldiers,
including you!

00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:57.310
Wufei.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:59.850
You and I are fighting
like this.

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:03.650
Don’t you feel fulfilled as
I do, when you’re fighting?

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:06.230
You and I are the same!

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:10.270
We can only acknowledge our
existence on the battlefield!

00:07:14.590 --> 00:07:17.160
Just remember, Wufei,
Treize is dead!

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:18.620
You’ve already defeated him!

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.060
You’re wrong!

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:22.450
I still fight him, even now!

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:37.270
Zechs.

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:40.140
The Brussels Presidential
Residence is shielded!

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:41.690
We can’t get to it!

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:43.100
I realize that!

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:47.020
But unless I do what I can,
no one will stand against them!

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:52.780
Who are you waiting for?

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:54.950
For those who hope for peace.

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:57.660
If people allow Mariemaia
to do as she wishes…

00:07:57.660 --> 00:08:00.410
…they’ll create a second
Milliardo Peacecraft.

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:17.510
Noin.

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:19.810
You don’t have to stick by me.

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:20.430
Zechs.

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:24.800
I told you a year ago that
I’ll never leave your side.

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:27.940
I’ve waited all this time.

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:30.350
I don’t want to wait any more.

00:08:30.880 --> 00:08:32.030
Understood.

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:49.920
I do not consent to
Relena Peacecraft’s ways.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:53.130
Her belief that peace comes
from discarding weapons…

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:55.050
…and confining soldiers
is wrong!

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:57.430
So that’s why you’re allowing
Mariemaia’s autocracy?!

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:00.920
That’s where the souls of
soldiers are congregated!

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:04.770
That may be okay for now.

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:07.940
But Mariemaia will end up
repeating history!

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.560
A history full of miserable
wars.

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:12.530
Unless we stop this
process now…

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:15.740
…more soldiers like ourselves
will become necessary.

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:16.780
If that happens…

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:20.870
…a history of tragedy will
keep repeating itself.

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:22.600
Wufei, tell me.

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:24.950
How many more people
must we kill?

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:34.540
How many more times must
I kill that girl and her dog?

00:09:41.110 --> 00:09:43.470
Zero won’t tell me anything.

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:45.890
<i>Tell me, Wufei!</i>

00:10:14.110 --> 00:10:17.830
Would an event like that
have to be repeated?

00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:25.520
<i>Are you both ready to go?</i>

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:27.970
Yeah, anytime you are!

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:30.880
This is what Operation Meteor
should be.

00:10:30.880 --> 00:10:32.020
Let’s go!

00:10:49.470 --> 00:10:52.840
Tallgeese and Taurus are past
our point D number 3 defenses!

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:54.800
What can they do with
only two suits?!

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:57.340
Send our remaining assault
troops to point D.

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:58.670
Yes, sir!

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:03.210
Looks like a sibling reunion
will be difficult this time.

00:11:05.110 --> 00:11:07.180
<i>We are facing fools…</i>

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:10.560
<i>…that are hopelessly rebelling
against the new order.</i>

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:15.940
<i>Consider the significance of
the lives that will be lost.</i>

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:17.070
Grandpa.

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:19.650
I thought there wouldn’t
be any more wars.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:21.360
That’s right.

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:25.330
Then, why are those people
still having a war?

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:26.910
Unfortunately…

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:31.070
…not everyone in the world
is as sensible as you.

00:11:32.730 --> 00:11:36.020
But in fact people
are too sensible.

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:39.510
Too few people are
retaliating against Mariemaia.

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:45.600
Does she believe this
is Treize’s ideal?

00:11:45.990 --> 00:11:49.930
She doesn’t realize she’s
merely Dekim’s puppet.

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:37.520
This is it.

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:39.900
I’m not saying any
goodbyes yet, Zechs!

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.560
Of course not!

00:12:48.880 --> 00:12:51.690
I’m glad we weren’t too late.

00:12:51.690 --> 00:12:53.160
Quatre?!

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:01.800
You two are truly impressive.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:05.130
You’ve fought this many
without killing one soldier.

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:08.460
I’d be glad if we could teach
these people something.

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:24.900
Let’s take the weapons
and war itself with us to hell!

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:44.420
About two hundred fifty left.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:46.360
That’s fifty suits each.

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:49.210
If that’s all, then we should
be able to manage.

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:55.680
Gundams?!

00:13:57.870 --> 00:14:01.610
How much longer will those
punks retaliate against me?!

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:03.860
Even if they did destroy
the mobile suits…

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:07.160
…there’s no way they can
break into this shelter.

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:10.070
What they’re doing
is meaningless.

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:14.260
I’ve been…

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:15.900
What’s wrong, Relena?

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:21.290
I’ve been…

00:14:24.020 --> 00:14:26.790
I’ve been running from
the truth!

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:31.640
<i>People!</i>

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:34.680
<i>Do not fear the broadcast
you’re watching!</i>

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:37.810
<i>Peace is not something
that is handed to you.</i>

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:39.300
<i>Each person must…</i>

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:41.270
Hey, wasn’t that!

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:43.220
That was Queen Relena!

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:47.030
It’s still much too early for
your appearance to the people…

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:48.480
…Former Queen.

00:14:50.130 --> 00:14:53.490
Are you guiding the public
to battle?

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:57.150
Doesn’t that go against your
Total Peace Policies?!

00:14:57.470 --> 00:15:00.290
I am no longer a Peacecraft.

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:04.300
What’s needed now is not
a principle or an assertion.

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:06.620
But the heart to hope for peace.

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:28.880
Gundam pilots…

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:30.030
…that’s enough!

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:31.660
Leave us and retreat.

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:32.860
Retreat?!

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:40.540
If we were fighting to kill,
we’d be done long ago.

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:43.530
But then coming back here
would be meaningless!

00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:48.460
At this rate, you’d die in vain!

00:15:50.190 --> 00:15:53.650
If we’d planned on retreating,
we would’ve been gone.

00:15:53.650 --> 00:15:56.550
I know it’ll be tough
to keep fighting, though.

00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:05.730
We used to be just like them.

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:08.070
Dekim coaxed them into
believing…

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:09.900
…their reason for living
is to fight.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:10.780
<i>But…</i>

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:13.240
Hey, don’t worry about it.

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:16.570
We’ve gotten pretty good at
these losing battles!

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:27.000
That’s why we could always
be true to ourselves.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.420
I didn’t go back to
being a Darlian…

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:31.470
…to get revenge for my father.

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:33.880
Nothing can be achieved
through revenge.

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:36.970
Hatred will only result in
breeding more hatred!

00:16:37.130 --> 00:16:40.390
You only think that way
because you lost your battle.

00:16:40.390 --> 00:16:42.180
But I’m different.

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:44.310
I will truly be victorious.

00:16:44.310 --> 00:16:46.770
The Gundams have all
stopped fighting.

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:47.810
Told you.

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:53.240
I’ve got nothing left.

00:16:53.240 --> 00:16:56.120
Self-detonating could take out
about half the suits left.

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:57.660
What do you think?

00:16:57.660 --> 00:16:58.450
No.

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:00.830
Detonation should be done
away from them.

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:02.960
Limit the casualties to
just ourselves.

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:04.530
Guess you’re right.

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:09.560
What?!

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:10.370
Above us!

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:15.830
Wing Zero!

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:22.900
Locked onto target!

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:25.390
Another Gundam confirmed!

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:26.690
What?!

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:27.690
Mr. Dekim!

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:30.020
We’re online with one of
the Gundam pilots!

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:31.210
Heero!

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:32.780
<i>Let me confirm.</i>

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:34.700
<i>Your shelter shield’s activated?</i>

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:36.320
What are you planning?!

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:38.200
<i>Your shelter is secure?</i>

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:39.490
Of course it is.

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:42.540
Admit to yourselves just
how powerless you are!

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:43.780
<i>Roger.</i>

00:17:54.020 --> 00:17:56.010
Gather all the Serpents here!

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:58.040
Shoot down Wing Zero!

00:17:58.490 --> 00:18:00.350
What a miserable person.

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:03.100
He’s not going to prove
anything.

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:04.970
Are you afraid, Mariemaia?

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:16.240
That’s impossible!

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:18.300
How could this be happening?!

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:20.450
The shield’s lost half
its strength!

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:23.870
Wing Zero’s aim is accurate
to one hundredth of a unit!

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:28.250
This shelter will collapse if it’s
hit again in the same place!

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:29.600
Stop it!

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:32.330
Relena Peacecraft is in here!

00:18:36.610 --> 00:18:37.960
Heero…

00:19:02.970 --> 00:19:04.330
Heero!

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:31.250
Are you okay?

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:32.400
Who are you?

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:34.900
Even though you may
be mistaken…

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:38.230
…I can’t allow the daughter of
His Excellency, Treize, to die.

00:19:41.010 --> 00:19:42.240
Mr. Dekim!

00:19:42.240 --> 00:19:45.620
Another Gundam has arrived at
defense line number 4 point E!

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:46.860
Also…

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:51.620
There is no way we’d obey you!

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:53.830
We don’t want any more wars!

00:19:55.890 --> 00:19:59.160
We want to protect the peace
here ourselves!

00:20:01.530 --> 00:20:05.620
Battles like these are not
decided by the soldiers.

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:09.170
Thanks to them,
I can give up fighting!

00:20:09.700 --> 00:20:12.060
This is goodbye, Treize.

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:15.020
Zechs.

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:17.690
This is good.

00:20:17.690 --> 00:20:20.900
We don’t have to abandon
hope just yet.

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:23.700
The detonating device missed
its chance again.

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:25.370
Who the hell are they?!

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:27.990
While His Excellency fought
losing battles…

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:31.290
…he truly loved people
who weren’t afraid to fight.

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:34.620
And that’s why people can
accept the Gundams.

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:38.950
It is not the victor that moves
the heart of the people.

00:20:48.360 --> 00:20:49.390
This is crazy!

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:51.390
We cannot be defeated!

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:52.940
We, the Barton family…

00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:55.560
…are the true rulers
of the Earth Sphere!

00:20:55.560 --> 00:20:57.310
Miss Mariemaia!

00:20:57.310 --> 00:21:00.350
Assume your position
as head of the Earth Sphere!

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:03.560
I am… victorious…

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:10.110
I’m carrying out my
father’s desires…

00:21:14.470 --> 00:21:15.780
Forgive me!

00:21:19.560 --> 00:21:20.960
Excuse me.

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:23.670
But it’s time you opened
your eyes, Mariemaia.

00:21:25.860 --> 00:21:27.640
Relena…

00:21:27.860 --> 00:21:30.560
You have learned what
real fear is.

00:21:30.560 --> 00:21:35.840
So I’m sure you can see
all the mistakes you’ve made.

00:21:36.350 --> 00:21:38.560
Stop right there,
Relena Peacecraft.

00:21:38.870 --> 00:21:43.070
I can’t allow you to brainwash
my Mariemaia with such trash!

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:45.740
If you wish to shoot me,
go right ahead!

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:47.650
I’m prepared to die!

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:51.330
Then I’ll tell you the truth
before you die!

00:21:51.330 --> 00:21:53.610
The public must obey the victor!

00:22:00.600 --> 00:22:01.830
Mariemaia!

00:22:04.820 --> 00:22:07.930
We can always create a
replacement for Mariemaia!

00:22:07.930 --> 00:22:09.780
I made her after all!

00:22:09.780 --> 00:22:11.090
Dekim!

00:22:22.000 --> 00:22:24.230
I’ve executed the rebel.

00:22:24.230 --> 00:22:27.980
I express my apologies for
betraying His Excellency, Treize.

00:22:34.640 --> 00:22:37.110
Mariemaia, hold on!

00:22:37.760 --> 00:22:41.120
Relena, I was mistaken.

00:22:41.120 --> 00:22:42.790
I’m sorry.

00:22:43.310 --> 00:22:44.480
Mariemaia.

00:22:44.480 --> 00:22:46.370
I’ll put you of your misery.

00:22:47.570 --> 00:22:48.880
Heero.

00:22:53.530 --> 00:22:55.010
Thank you.

00:23:03.670 --> 00:23:05.980
I’ve killed Mariemaia.

00:23:08.210 --> 00:23:10.360
I… I…

00:23:10.670 --> 00:23:13.030
I will never kill again.

00:23:13.340 --> 00:23:16.240
I don’t have to kill any more.

00:23:19.080 --> 00:23:20.200
Heero!

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:28.540
Heero…

00:23:30.110 --> 00:23:31.840
There’s still hope for her!

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:32.800
Take her to the doctor!

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:33.350
Yes, Ma’am!

00:23:34.210 --> 00:23:36.720
Finally it’s over.

00:23:48.590 --> 00:23:51.440
This time it’s good-bye
for real, buddy.

00:24:02.770 --> 00:24:05.510
I’ve become nameless again.

00:24:05.510 --> 00:24:07.170
Trowa sounds fine to me.

00:24:07.170 --> 00:24:09.300
Why not keep it, Trowa?

00:24:09.300 --> 00:24:11.340
Names are given to you
by others.

00:24:11.340 --> 00:24:14.010
No point wasting time
worrying about it.

00:24:14.010 --> 00:24:16.850
What’s important is having
a place we can call home.

00:24:16.850 --> 00:24:17.950
Right?

00:24:17.950 --> 00:24:20.180
Yeah, you’re right.

00:24:38.300 --> 00:24:41.070
Nataku, may you rest in peace.

00:24:41.430 --> 00:24:42.700
Wufei.

00:24:43.270 --> 00:24:45.960
Noin and Zechs have
disappeared somewhere.

00:24:45.960 --> 00:24:49.620
What do you say?
Wanna come work with me?

00:24:50.190 --> 00:24:52.370
As a Preventer?

00:24:54.030 --> 00:24:55.420
Why not?

00:24:59.910 --> 00:25:01.450
Are you sure?

00:25:01.450 --> 00:25:04.690
The Terra Formation Project
hasn’t officially started yet.

00:25:04.690 --> 00:25:08.710
Relena is working on it,
and it won’t be easy.

00:25:08.710 --> 00:25:12.090
That’s why a dead person
would be perfect for the job.

00:25:12.090 --> 00:25:13.950
Noin, are you sure you…

00:25:13.950 --> 00:25:17.480
Don’t make me repeat
myself, Zechs.

00:25:23.850 --> 00:25:26.640
After Colony 197.

00:25:26.640 --> 00:25:29.590
Peace has returned
to the people.

00:25:29.590 --> 00:25:32.800
And from this point on…

00:25:32.800 --> 00:25:36.880
…weapons known as mobile
suits, including the Gundams…

00:25:36.880 --> 00:25:40.630
…were never seen again.

00:25:47.660 --> 00:25:50.940
<i>I feel love, reflection</i>

00:25:50.940 --> 00:25:54.190
<i>mitsumekaesu hitomi ni</i>

00:25:50.940 --> 00:25:54.190
<i>The reflection of your eyes
looking at me</i>

00:25:54.190 --> 00:25:57.240
<i>egaite haruka na</i>

00:25:54.190 --> 00:25:57.240
<i>Is etched in my mind
as an everlasting</i>

00:25:57.240 --> 00:26:04.040
<i>Never-ending story</i>

00:26:23.930 --> 00:26:27.480
<i>kanashimi mo itami mo</i>

00:26:23.930 --> 00:26:27.480
<i>Beating these wings
with all my might</i>

00:26:27.480 --> 00:26:30.650
<i>furikiru you ni habataku</i>

00:26:27.480 --> 00:26:30.650
<i>To shake off all sadness,
shake off all pain</i>

00:26:30.650 --> 00:26:33.530
<i>anata ga kureta tsubasa wo</i>

00:26:30.650 --> 00:26:33.530
<i>These wings will always
be spread across my heart</i>

00:26:33.530 --> 00:26:37.320
<i>kono mune ni hirogete</i>

00:26:33.530 --> 00:26:37.320
<i>These wings that I received
from you</i>

00:26:37.320 --> 00:26:43.700
<i>aa kakegaenai ai no kodou wo</i>

00:26:37.320 --> 00:26:43.700
<i>As painful as it may be
and as upset as I may get</i>

00:26:43.700 --> 00:26:50.500
<i>setsunaku kuruoshiku kanjite itai</i>

00:26:43.700 --> 00:26:50.500
<i>I hope to keep feeling
this precious love beating</i>

00:26:50.500 --> 00:26:53.750
<i>I feel love, reflection</i>

00:26:53.750 --> 00:26:57.170
<i>atsuku yume wo kasanete</i>

00:26:53.750 --> 00:26:57.170
<i>We’ll have many passionate
dreams together</i>

00:26:57.170 --> 00:27:00.510
<i>ayamachi osorezu ni</i>

00:26:57.170 --> 00:27:00.510
<i>Unafraid to make mistakes</i>

00:27:00.510 --> 00:27:03.720
<i>motomeau seishun</i>

00:27:00.510 --> 00:27:03.720
<i>We’ll look to each other</i>

00:27:03.720 --> 00:27:07.020
<i>I feel love, reflection</i>

00:27:07.020 --> 00:27:10.190
<i>mitsumekaesu hitomi ni</i>

00:27:07.020 --> 00:27:10.190
<i>The reflection of your eyes
looking at me</i>

00:27:10.190 --> 00:27:13.360
<i>egaite haruka na</i>

00:27:10.190 --> 00:27:13.360
<i>Is etched in my mind
as an everlasting</i>

00:27:13.360 --> 00:27:20.200
<i>Never-ending story</i>
